# Individual: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/A-PER-M> (安培每米)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/A-PER-M> "is the SI unit of magnetic field strength. One ampere per meter is equal to $\\pi/250$ oersteds
    ($12.566\\, 371\\,millioersteds$) in CGS units. The ampere per meter is also the SI unit of \"magnetization\" in the sense of
    magnetic dipole moment per unit volume; in this context $1 A/m = 0.001\\,emu\\,per\\,cubic\\,centimeter$.
  "^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/expression> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/A-PER-M> "$A/m$"^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/A-PER-M> "https://cdd.iec.ch/cdd/iec62720/iec62720.nsf/Units/0112-2---62720%23UAA104"^^xsd:anyURI)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/A-PER-M> "A/m")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/wikidataMatch> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/A-PER-M> <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q2844478>)
