AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DEG_C-PER-HR> "$\\textit{Degree Celsius per Hour}$ is a unit for 'Temperature Per Time' expressed as $degC / h$.
